  "reason": "The existing evidence is entirely absent, so the first experiment should test a baseline multimodal configuration to establish whether combining RNA and image data improves performance. This experiment tests the effectiveness of multimodal fusion (concat) with standard encoders (pca_n2000 for RNA, resnet50 for images) and singleprofile setting, which is a critical design choice. It is the best use of the first experiment as it directly addresses the primary objective of multimodal cellular profiling and reduces uncertainty about the value of combining modalities."
